---
// Quiz figure for Post 2: the same account settings page (same h1 and h2 tags) styled two ways.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq02settingspage">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 250" role="img" aria-label="Two versions of an account settings page built from the same h1 and h2 tags. Version 1: a 30px Manage account title and 20px bold section titles, with the email linh@example.com and the plan at 13px grey. Version 2: an 17px title and 13px grey section titles, with the email and the plan at 17px semibold dark.">
    <text x="6" y="22" class="num">1</text>
    <rect x="28" y="6" width="270" height="226" rx="10" class="card" />
    <text x="44" y="52" class="h1a"><tspan data-lang-en>Manage account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quản lý tài khoản</tspan></text>
    <text x="44" y="94" class="h2a"><tspan data-lang-en>Email address</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Địa chỉ email</tspan></text>
    <text x="44" y="116" class="va">linh@example.com</text>
    <text x="44" y="162" class="h2a"><tspan data-lang-en>Plan</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gói dịch vụ</tspan></text>
    <text x="44" y="184" class="va"><tspan data-lang-en>Pro, renews 1 Dec</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pro, gia hạn 1/12</tspan></text>

    <text x="316" y="22" class="num">2</text>
    <rect x="338" y="6" width="254" height="226" rx="10" class="card" />
    <text x="354" y="40" class="h1b"><tspan data-lang-en>Manage account</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quản lý tài khoản</tspan></text>
    <text x="354" y="84" class="h2b"><tspan data-lang-en>Email address</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Địa chỉ email</tspan></text>
    <text x="354" y="110" class="vb">linh@example.com</text>
    <text x="354" y="156" class="h2b"><tspan data-lang-en>Plan</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Gói dịch vụ</tspan></text>
    <text x="354" y="182" class="vb"><tspan data-lang-en>Pro, renews 1 Dec</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pro, gia hạn 1/12</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .num { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .h1a { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .h2a { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .va { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .h1b { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .h2b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq02settingspage .vb { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
</style>
